  "details": "# Issue:\nI've been in a few worlds over the last few days where I could see things that are behind the Personal Mirror. I'm not sure what causes it, but I think it's probably related to fog.\n**Steps to reproduce: (VR Only)**\n1. Go to a world with fog (I used: wrld_5a1a214e-23da-4ca4-95a5-9a41db17ee4e)\n2. Turn on the Personal Mirror (Full Opacity and Environment enabled)\nIf you do this you will be able to see the things behind the Mirror.\n# Attachments:\nThe first picture is with the Mirror on and the second one with it being off. (Both pictures were taken at the exact same position)",
